# Staged source memoirs / drafts — kept locally, never deployed to public site.
# Per the IRREVERSIBLE no-names + brand-scrub policy, these often contain raw
# names and brand references that must NOT reach the served Pages site. Move
# the drafts here, work on them, run them through agents to extract polished
# docs, then delete (or leave them locally; .gitignore will keep them out of git).
docs/memoir_*.md
